Algorithm for file updates in Python 
Project descriptionProject description 
In this project, I created a Python algorithm to manage an allow list of IP addresses for 
employees who can access restricted patient records. The goal was to automatically remove 
IP addresses that appear on a separate remove list so only authorized employees can access 
the restricted network. The algorithm reads data from a file, updates the list, and writes the 
revised information back to the original file. Automating this process helps reduce errors and 
makes access management more efficient. 
