SummarySummary 
This algorithm show the process of updating an allow list of IP addresses. It opens the file then 
reads its contents and converts the data into a list so each IP address can be processed 
individually. The program loops through the remove list and removes any matching IP 
addresses from the allow list. After the updates are complete, it converts the list back into a 
string and writes the revised information back to the file. 
